language design-core version 0.5.
unit AstParser.
functionality BuildPositionedAst.
functionality CompileSource.
scenario CompileUiAccepted.
channel CompileUiCalls.
contract CompileUiInput.
contract CompileUiOutput.
contract CompileUiProtocol.
message CompileUiRejected.
scenario CompileUiRejectedScenario.
message CompileUiRequest.
message CompileUiResult.
field DiagnosticText.
field EntryName.
activity ExistingCapability.
functionality ExpandReusableDefinitions.
unit Frontend.
activity IndependentPackaging.
usecase InspectUiDefinition.
unit Lexer.
interface LocalProfilePort.
field ModelProjection.
unit Normalizer.
functionality PreserveInstancePaths.
unit ProfileValidator.
contract RejectionDiagnostic.
field RejectionText.
functionality ReturnSourceDiagnostics.
container SduiCommand.
unit SourceCaller.
mode SourceInspection.
field SourceText.
interface SourceTextPort.
functionality TokenizeSource.
actor UiAuthor.
interface UiCompilePort.
capability UiSourceCompilation.
functionality ValidateLocalWidgets.
functionality ValidateRelativeFormatting.
functionality ValidateSymbolicBindings.
feature ValidatedUiModels.
AstParser owns BuildPositionedAst.
BuildPositionedAst allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
BuildPositionedAst contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
BuildPositionedAst realizes UiSourceCompilation.
CompileSource allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
CompileSource contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
CompileSource realizes UiSourceCompilation.
CompileUiAccepted exercises InspectUiDefinition.
CompileUiAccepted has completeness = closed.
CompileUiAccepted runs-in SourceInspection.
CompileUiAccepted step 1 sends CompileUiRequest from SourceCaller to Frontend via CompileUiCalls.
CompileUiAccepted step 2 sends CompileUiResult from Frontend to SourceCaller via CompileUiCalls reply-to 1.
CompileUiCalls upholds CompileUiProtocol.
CompileUiInput has completeness = closed.
CompileUiInput has-field EntryName.
CompileUiInput has-field SourceText.
CompileUiOutput has completeness = closed.
CompileUiOutput has-field DiagnosticText.
CompileUiOutput has-field ModelProjection.
CompileUiProtocol has completeness = closed.
CompileUiProtocol permits CompileUiRejected.
CompileUiProtocol permits CompileUiRequest.
CompileUiProtocol permits CompileUiResult.
CompileUiRejected has message-kind = result.
CompileUiRejected replies-to CompileUiRequest.
CompileUiRejected upholds RejectionDiagnostic.
CompileUiRejectedScenario exercises InspectUiDefinition.
CompileUiRejectedScenario has completeness = closed.
CompileUiRejectedScenario runs-in SourceInspection.
CompileUiRejectedScenario step 1 sends CompileUiRequest from SourceCaller to Frontend via CompileUiCalls.
CompileUiRejectedScenario step 2 sends CompileUiRejected from Frontend to SourceCaller via CompileUiCalls reply-to 1.
CompileUiRequest has message-kind = request.
CompileUiRequest upholds CompileUiInput.
CompileUiResult has message-kind = result.
CompileUiResult replies-to CompileUiRequest.
CompileUiResult upholds CompileUiOutput.
DiagnosticText has presence = required.
DiagnosticText has value-type = text.
EntryName has presence = required.
EntryName has value-type = text.
ExistingCapability addresses BuildPositionedAst.
ExistingCapability addresses CompileSource.
ExistingCapability addresses ExpandReusableDefinitions.
ExistingCapability addresses PreserveInstancePaths.
ExistingCapability addresses ReturnSourceDiagnostics.
ExistingCapability addresses TokenizeSource.
ExistingCapability addresses ValidateLocalWidgets.
ExistingCapability addresses ValidateRelativeFormatting.
ExistingCapability addresses ValidateSymbolicBindings.
ExistingCapability delivers ValidatedUiModels.
ExistingCapability has implementation-status = implemented.
ExpandReusableDefinitions allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
ExpandReusableDefinitions contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
ExpandReusableDefinitions realizes UiSourceCompilation.
Frontend consumes SourceTextPort.
Frontend contains AstParser.
Frontend contains Lexer.
Frontend contains Normalizer.
Frontend contains ProfileValidator.
Frontend owns CompileSource.
Frontend owns ReturnSourceDiagnostics.
Frontend provides UiSourceCompilation.
Frontend uses CompileUiCalls as receiver of CompileUiRequest in mode SourceInspection.
Frontend uses CompileUiCalls as sender of CompileUiRejected in mode SourceInspection.
Frontend uses CompileUiCalls as sender of CompileUiResult in mode SourceInspection.
IndependentPackaging has implementation-status = planned.
Lexer owns TokenizeSource.
ModelProjection has presence = required.
ModelProjection has value-type = bytes.
Normalizer owns ExpandReusableDefinitions.
Normalizer owns PreserveInstancePaths.
PreserveInstancePaths allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
PreserveInstancePaths contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
PreserveInstancePaths realizes UiSourceCompilation.
ProfileValidator consumes LocalProfilePort.
ProfileValidator owns ValidateLocalWidgets.
ProfileValidator owns ValidateRelativeFormatting.
ProfileValidator owns ValidateSymbolicBindings.
RejectionDiagnostic has completeness = closed.
RejectionDiagnostic has-field RejectionText.
RejectionText has presence = required.
RejectionText has value-type = text.
ReturnSourceDiagnostics allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
ReturnSourceDiagnostics contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
ReturnSourceDiagnostics realizes UiSourceCompilation.
SduiCommand contains Frontend.
SourceCaller consumes UiCompilePort.
SourceCaller uses CompileUiCalls as receiver of CompileUiRejected in mode SourceInspection.
SourceCaller uses CompileUiCalls as receiver of CompileUiResult in mode SourceInspection.
SourceCaller uses CompileUiCalls as sender of CompileUiRequest in mode SourceInspection.
SourceText has presence = required.
SourceText has value-type = text.
TokenizeSource allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
TokenizeSource contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
TokenizeSource realizes UiSourceCompilation.
UiAuthor pursues InspectUiDefinition.
UiSourceCompilation requires UiCompilePort in mode SourceInspection.
ValidateLocalWidgets allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
ValidateLocalWidgets contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
ValidateLocalWidgets realizes UiSourceCompilation.
ValidateRelativeFormatting allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
ValidateRelativeFormatting contributes-to ValidatedUiModels.
ValidateRelativeFormatting realizes UiSourceCompilation.
ValidateSymbolicBindings allocated-to SduiCommand in mode SourceInspection.
